<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<!-- $title = KARRINYUP.txt -->
<!-- $desc = Aligned with Karrinyup’s own metamorphosis while their rennovations were underway, we sought to express this joy in Karrinyup Shopping Centre’s SS20/21 campaign idea – ‘Renew You’. -->
<!-- @import '../head.kit' -->

<body class="">
    <!-- @import '../header.kit' -->
    <div class="main">
        <div class="project-intro typewriter">
            <div class="project-intro-inner">
                <h1 class="project-title" data-chars="1" data-speed="50">Karrinyup Spring/Summer 20/21</h1>
                <hr>
                <div class="project-details-wrapper">
                    <div class="project-details">
                        <h2>Client</h2>
                        <p>AMP Capital</p>
                        <h2>Involvement</h2>
                        <p>Campaign Development</p>
                        <p>Photoshoot Creative Direction</p>
                        <p>Photomanipulation and Compositing</p>
                        <p>Signage</p>
                        <p>Social Media Content </p>
                        <h2>Credits</h2>
                        <p>Portrait Photography — <a href="https://www.instagram.com/chantelconcei/" target="_blank">Chantel&nbsp;Concei</a></p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="project-description">
                        <h2>Challenge</h2>
                        <p>We were briefed to drive preference for Karrinyup, increase average spend of customers and elevate the brand in line with Karrinyup’s vision, at a time when the people of Perth were coming out of the confines of COVID and emerging from what felt like the longest winter.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="project-description">
                        <h2>Solution</h2>
                        <p>Aligned with Karrinyup’s own metamorphosis – they are currently in the process of a major renovation – so too were the people of Perth. Everyone was looking for a reason to celebrate. We sought to express this joy in Karrinyup Shopping Centre’s SS20/21 campaign idea – ‘Renew You’.</p>
                        <p>After the creation of the campaign idea, I oversaw the entire execution from directing the photoshoot and contributing to the styling, to the editing and compositing for the final imagery.</p>
                        <p>The final shoot and the installation involved over 1,000 hand folded butterflies that I designed - I even folded a few hundred of them.</p>
                        <div class="collab-logos wait-for-typewriter">
                            <img alt="Cameron Murray" title="Cameron Murray" src="/assets/logo-cameron-murray.svg">
                            <img alt="Block Branding" title="Block Branding" src="/assets/logo-block.svg">
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="project-content">
            <div class="expandable"><img src="images/karrinyup-1.webp"></div>
            <div class="expandable"><img src="images/karrinyup-2.webp"></div>
            <div class="expandable"><img src="images/karrinyup-3.webp"></div>
            <div class="expandable"><img src="images/karrinyup-4.webp"></div>
            <div class="expandable"><img src="images/karrinyup-5.webp"></div>
            <div class="expandable"><img src="images/karrinyup-6.webp"></div>
            <div class="expandable"><img src="images/karrinyup-7.webp"></div>
            <div class="expandable"><img src="images/karrinyup-8.webp"></div>

            <div class="expandable">
                <video autoplay loop muted playsinline>
                  <source src="images/karrinyup-video-1.webm" type="video/webm">
                  Your browser does not support the video tag.
                </video>
            </div>

            <div class="expandable"><img src="images/karrinyup-9.webp"></div>
            <div class="expandable"><img src="images/karrinyup-10.webp"></div>
            <div class="expandable"><img src="images/karrinyup-11.webp"></div>
            <div class="expandable"><img src="images/karrinyup-12.webp"></div>
            <div class="expandable"><img src="images/karrinyup-13.webp"></div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <!-- @import '../footer.kit' -->
</body>

</html>